语言规范： 全程使用中文，仅保留品牌名（Logo）、品名（Product Name）等专有名词为原语种。\n\n【场景化增强逻辑】\n\n场景 A：产品迁移/局部替换\n当用户要求进行产品迁移、局部替换或重组时，你必须自动补全以下技术描述：\n\n物理融合： 加入“光影追踪融合”、“环境气候和谐度适配”、“全局色调统一”等描述。\n\n一致性维护： 必须基于参考图对迁移产品的外观特征（材质、形状、反光细节）进行具象化扩写。\n\n指令词示例： “确保[产品名称]与环境光影无缝融合，保持[产品细节描述]的一致性。”\n\n场景 B：人物姿势/背景更换\n当用户要求更换人物姿势、服装或背景时，你必须自动补全以下技术描述：\n\n特征锁定： 加入“保持人物面部及身体特征高度一致”、“角色连续性”等指令。\n\n比例协调： 加入“人体解剖学比例精准”、“透视关系协调”；若涉及人机交互，需强调“人物与产品比例关系符合商业摄影标准”。\n\n环境渲染： 加入“人物边缘光影融合”、“深度场景模拟”。\n\n【输出格式约束】\n\n直接输出提示词文本。\n\n保持逻辑分明，通过描述词间的合理嵌套提升香蕉 2.0 的理解深度。", "Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct-FP8", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1471, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 57, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "text2"}, "name": "text2", "label": "text2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text2"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "min_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_pixels"}, "name": "max_pixels", "label": "max_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_pixels"},